# Monorepo packages

pnpm + Turbo. Edit the package that owns the concern; do not copy UI or API logic across hosts.

| Package | Role |
|---|---|
| `packages/ui` | Presentational primitives + shared domain UI. No Tauri, PocketBase client, `$core`, `$app`, or i18n. Hosts pass `t()` via label props. |
| `packages/i18n` | Shared `en`/`es`/`ko` dictionaries, `createI18n`, and locale path helpers (`localizeHref`, `parseLocaleFromPath`). |
| `packages/api` | Shared PocketBase + `api.coh1stats.com` client (`createApi`). neverthrow + zod. No Svelte/Tauri/`$lib`. |
| `packages/app` | Tauri desktop (adapter-static). Features, `$core`, game, account. Module-singleton `t()`. |
| `packages/website` | Public site (Cloudflare). Fetches `api.coh1stats.com`. Per-request `t()` + `/es` `/ko` URL prefixes. No Tauri / `$core`. |
| `packages/pocketbase` | Schema migrations + JS hooks. Public HTTP APIs live here. |
| `packages/oppbot-overlay` | Overlay source. `pnpm overlays:build` copies dist into PocketBase public. |
| `packages/smurf-worker` | Cloudflare Worker for smurf scoring. Not app/website code. |
| `packages/shared-assets` | Screenshots and static assets. |

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — duplicate Button in website, or fetch Relic from a ui component
// ❌ BAD — pocketbase.collection(...) in app/website outside thin facades — use @company-of-heroes/api
// ✅ GOOD — Button in packages/ui; app/website import @company-of-heroes/ui/button
// ✅ GOOD — new public /api/player field → PocketBase hook, then createApi method in packages/api, thin UI in ui/app/website
```

Do not hand-edit hashed overlay files under `packages/pocketbase/pb_hooks/public/overlay-default/`. Change `packages/oppbot-overlay` and rebuild.
